                                "sense_id": "4a3c2fb2-49fd-32d9-9f82-b9bc7cccbf80",
                                "text": "Nor is progress exclusively a Western invention. Many interpret the Tao of ancient China as a guide for those who wish to progress as they make their way forward in the world—though its conception of progress is very different from what emerged in the West."
                            }
                        ]
